#: templates/index.html:43
msgid ""
"We designed the Data Registry to help you find and access public procurement "
"datasets that are available in the <a href=\"https://standard.open-"
"contracting.org/latest/en/primer/what/\" target=\"_blank\">OCDS format</a>."
